*.log
node_modules/
.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees/

# Design canvases and planning notes are working material, not something a
# user installing the plugin should have to download. They live outside the
# repository; see AGENTS.md for what is kept and why.
docs/design/
docs/superpowers/
target/
app/**/gpui.d.ts

# Cargo.lock is deliberately *not* ignored. gpui and gpui-component are git
# dependencies with no version to pin, so without the lock a release build
# resolves whatever is on their default branches that morning — a binary that
# differs from the one the change was tested against, with nothing in the tree
# to say how. It is committed, and the release workflow builds `--locked`, so
# two builds of one tag are the same build.

# The Google OAuth client lives in ~/.config/omamail; an old build wrote it
# here, and a client id and secret must never be committed.
oauth-client.json
